      "source_context": "Overview of Sage Sage is an attractive culinary herb. Salvia officinalis is an aromatic , rather woody perennial subshrub in the mint family (Lamiaceae) native to the shores of the northern Mediterranean. Its common names include culinary sage, common garden sage, and garden sage .",
